msgid ""
"Apply runtime viewport fit on approval/review process lists and approval job/"
"history detail screens."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Reviews: cap review process form modal body height with max-h so short forms "
"no longer reserve a fixed 500px empty area."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Approvals: scope delegation to ApprovalInstance.delegated_approver instead "
"of mutating shared process rules; replace alert()-based responses with "
"messages.error and HTMX reload; register ApprovalInstance for export_data. "
"Wrap approval form placeholders with gettext_lazy."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Re-raise HttpNotFound with exception chaining in process detail views to "
"preserve context."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Approvals: fixed type mismatch when excluding pending approval objects from "
"list view; added job detail body template and adjusted tab container height."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"ApprovalRuleForm refactored to fields=\"__all__\" with field_order, dropping "
"the unused process_config field and the redundant view fields list. Fixed a "
"KeyError on review-process create by adding keep_on_form for is_active. "
"Migrated signal imports to the db.models.signals shim and added docstrings "
"for pylint compliance."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Release 1.10: Process Builder consolidated under contrib.process with "
"approvals and reviews sub-apps. Django app labels for approvals and reviews "
"are unchanged; import paths and includes now use the contrib package layout."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Enhanced approval workflow with delete support in approval history, standard "
"HTMX modal delete flow, and inline edit enforcement for pending/rejected "
"records. Improved approval signals cleanup, review process table viewport "
"handling, and redirect behavior."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Introduced unified Process Builder combining reviews and approvals into a "
"flexible, condition-driven workflow engine with configurable approvers, "
"field-level controls, and per-app process configuration."
msgstr ""

